Initial Creation Date: 2009.09.08

Product added to build tree: IBM Discovery Library tools and CDM website.

Person performing tools isolation and addition to build tree: Petyo Dimitrov

Location the product was retrieved from:
https://rtpgsa.ibm.com/projects/c/cdm/web/2.10.10/files/index.htm
(The files listed there are for CDM version 2.10.10, so for newer versions 
for CDM, the URL will change. In this case go to 
https://rtpgsa.ibm.com/projects/c/cdm/web, select the needed version of CDM 
and use the 'Downloads' link at the beginning of the page.)

Any special instruction needed to get the product.  Like a special
user name or password. (May not be applicable): 
None.

Instruction on how you created the tools isolation for this product.
Please include platform you installed on, where you installed it, what
you copied where, etc.:

Download the dl_core.jar and CDMWebsite.zip and place them into adks/ibm/cdm/2.10.10 in CMVC.
Download the idmlcert.zip file (version 2.4.3). Extract it and take file idmlcert.jar (the icl.jar is 
present in the adks/ibm/dis/<version> folder). Place the idmlcert.jar file into adks/ibm/cdm/2.10.10 in CMVC.


Update History (Use only if you have to actually make more changes after the product
has been used in a tools tree build.  Should be rare) :
